          "kicker": "Coaching plan",
          "heading": "Jake White outlines Fiji's 2027 World Cup plan, starting with Japan",
          "body": "New Fiji coach Jake White used his Suva unveiling on Tuesday to outline a plan built on depth. White, the 2007 World Cup-winning Springbok coach, first faces Japan later this month, then France, Ireland and Italy in November. His immediate task is establishing who is eligible, available and injury-free. He also plans to watch club rugby and work with U18 and U20 coaches on a pathway for young players. \"Next year is about building depth,\" he said, with the final block reserved for peaking before the World Cup."
