          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "France lock Thibaud Flament reportedly ruled out of November Tests",
          "body": "Lock Thibaud Flament is reportedly out of France's November Tests with a shoulder injury, according to L'Équipe, leaving France coach Fabien Galthié short of another key option in the second row. The 29-year-old Toulouse forward, who played 80 minutes in Sunday's 45-34 Top 14 win over Bayonne, is said to face several weeks out. He had been tipped to pair with Emmanuel Meafou, himself recovering from a knee injury, for the Tests against Fiji, South Africa and Argentina."
        },
