          "heading": "Ireland women's Aoife Dalton stars in 43-19 win over Japan in Cork",
          "body": "Ireland women beat Japan 43-19 in Cork on Saturday 3 October, their second win over the Sakura XV in a week after the Galway result. Ireland scored three tries to race into a 22-7 lead, and flyhalf Dannah O'Brien's kicking caused Japan's defence serious problems. Japan, who had also lost in Galway, head home winless in four straight matches."
